{"key": "9cc1bc9e5c786c1f3117a9ce19880a18", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "**Depósitos das vendas de ontem (02/11/2026):**\n\n| Forma | Vendas | Total | Depósito | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Pix | 1 | R$ 64,00 | 02/11/2026 (ontem) | pago |\n| Débito | 2 | R$ 200,50 | 03/11/2026 (hoje) | pago |\n| Crédito | 2 | R$ 549,90 | 02/12/2026 (em 29 dias) | agendado |\n\nTotal das 5 vendas: R$ 814,40.\n\nRegra do registro: Pix D+0, débito D+1 dia útil, crédito D+30 (próximo dia útil).\n\nNão tenho informações sobre como funciona o Link de Pagamento. Essa dúvida é de outro especialista.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggRzfcLsgcyPwakRTxfm", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3899, "output_tokens": 273, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-01#0"}
{"key": "e1590a2ce65be14c2240169e2d32d081", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Ontem (02/11/2026) você teve 2 vendas recusadas, somando R$ 285,00:\n\n- **TX1007**: crédito, R$ 210,00, terminal T1988A. Código 51: saldo ou limite insuficiente no cartão do cliente. Peça outro cartão ou outra forma de pagamento.\n- **TX1008**: débito, R$ 75,00, terminal T1988B. Código 05: transação não autorizada pelo banco emissor (genérica). O portador deve contatar o banco emissor, ou você pode tentar outro cartão.\n\nSobre o número de parcelas no crediário, não encontrei essa informação nos seus registros. Essa dúvida fica com outro especialista.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggRzgrW8BtdexELMBcFL", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3869, "output_tokens": 244, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-03#0"}
{"key": "b2422f119a5661bc9a0bd72dee702029", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "É possível parcelar em até 48 vezes no cartão de crédito pelo Crediário [2]. O prazo máximo e a taxa de juros do parcelamento variam de acordo com o emissor do cartão [3]. Por isso, nem todo cartão chega a 48x.\n\nNa maquininha, escolha \"1. CREDITO\", informe o valor, escolha \"4. CREDIARIO\" e digite o número de parcelas [4].\n\nA segunda parte da sua pergunta, sobre as vendas recusadas, não é tratada aqui.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS28ojPut85Mo2KtZhv", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4170, "output_tokens": 184, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-03#0"}
{"key": "6dd2c4c6e3c4cd081ff94174ddaf6cc9", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "**Parcelas no Crediário:** dá para parcelar em até 48 vezes no cartão de crédito [prod-crediario-03]. O prazo máximo e os juros dependem do emissor do cartão, então nem todo cartão chega a 48x [prod-crediario-02]. Na maquininha, escolha \"1. CREDITO\", informe o valor, escolha \"4. CREDIARIO\" e digite o número de parcelas [prod-crediario-05].\n\n**Vendas recusadas (ontem, 02/11/2026):** foram 2 vendas, num total de R$ 285,00.\n- **TX1007**: crédito, R$ 210,00, terminal T1988A. Código 51: saldo ou limite insuficiente no cartão. Peça outro cartão ou outra forma de pagamento.\n- **TX1008**: débito, R$ 75,00, terminal T1988B. Código 05: não autorizada pelo banco emissor (genérica). O portador deve falar com o banco emissor, ou você pode tentar outro cartão.\n\nSe quiser, posso encaminhar você a um atendente humano.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS2Lj6XnUAdX4aGBd4o", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3571, "output_tokens": 374, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "parallel-03#0"}
{"key": "8a8333b50f82ff5a31de1b11cb86fc24", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, in practice you do. To sign up for Pix with Getnet you must enter one Pix key that is linked to the account where you want to receive payments [2]. You enter the same key you registered with your bank account (domicílio bancário) where you will receive Pix [5]. Pix itself can be made through a checking account, savings account, or prepaid payment account [1].\n\nThe sources don't say whether a specific account type is required for Getnet's Pix product beyond that.\n\nMISSING: whether Getnet requires a specific account type for Pix", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS2V2eZoPKmhf1P8Kyg", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3375, "output_tokens": 171, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-04#0"}
{"key": "b5b1b94c55af1963c4cf76835b0e80f6", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Smart is a smart card machine (terminal) that makes your day-to-day simpler and more digital. You can control inventory, place orders, close tabs, load a menu and issue invoices directly on the device [1]. It can also be integrated with your establishment's system [1]. It runs on Android, which allows more operations on the device itself, such as managing the menu, controlling stock and exchanging messages between kitchen and dining room, and all your sales on it are processed by Getnet [4]. The listed price is R$ 129,90/month [2].\n\nYour question about whether your terminals are online is handled separately, so I haven't covered it here.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS2SaojgM4eGyRqzzYm", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3682, "output_tokens": 204, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
