{"key": "b0327c4a848e117d2804747909ffd214", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Smart is a smart card machine that lets you control stock, place orders, close tabs, load menus and issue invoices directly on the device, and it can be integrated with your establishment's system [1]. It runs Android, and all sales on it are processed by Getnet [4].\n\nFor the Get Clássica offline / no-signal troubleshooting steps, the passages don't include any connection troubleshooting guidance, so I can't give you steps from the sources.\n\nI can look up your terminals' connection status, signal and time offline with get_terminal_status, which I run immediately on your own data [policy:capabilities]. If you share the terminal ID (e.g., T1988A), I can check it. I can also propose opening a technical support ticket for a terminal, but it only runs after you confirm, and the proposal expires after 15 minutes [policy:capabilities].\n\nMISSING: Get Clássica offline/no-signal connection troubleshooting steps", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS2pe7imFvNP1QEVk5f", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3702, "output_tokens": 301, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
{"key": "02956e6a4aecdf8ccd22f19354d0422f", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "**What the Get Smart is:** It's a smart card machine. On the device you can control stock, place orders, close tabs, load a menu and issue invoices. It can also be integrated with your establishment's system [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10]. It runs Android, and Getnet processes all sales made on it [sup-duvidas-get-smart-17]. The listed price is R$ 129,90/month [prod-todas-as-maquininhas-04].\n\n**Your terminals:** One is online and one is offline.\n- **T1988A (Get Smart):** Online on Wi-Fi with good signal. Last contact was 2026-11-03 18:00.\n- **T1988B (Get Clássica):** Offline on chip with no signal. It has been offline for 5 hours, since its last contact at 2026-11-03 13:00.\n\nThe sources I have don't include connection troubleshooting steps for T1988B, so I can't give you any.\n\nI can propose a technical support ticket for T1988B. Nothing runs until you confirm, and the proposal expires after 15 minutes [policy:capabilities]. Do you want me to propose it? I can also hand your case to a human agent.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS3MiA44KE99Vt2j74s", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4057, "output_tokens": 381, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
